    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University organised a seminar to commemorate World Mental Health Day on October 11, 2010, choosing the theme 'Burden of Care in Mental Illness'. Pivotal issues such as the stigma attached to mental illness, supporting and taking care of the mentally challenged, and the stress of doing so in the Pakistani context were the main focus of the two-hour evening session.",
